␀ö␀␀è␀␀ÿÿ‚␀C␀l␀i␀c␀k␀ ␀N␀e␀x␀t␀ ␀t␀o␀ ␀b␀e␀g␀i␀n␀ ␀t␀h␀e␀ ␀i␀n␀s␀t␀a␀l␀l␀a␀t␀i␀o␀n␀.␀ ␀I␀f␀ ␀y␀o␀u␀ ␀w␀a␀n␀t␀ ␀t␀o␀ ␀r␀e␀v␀i␀e␀w␀ ␀o␀r␀ ␀c␀h␀a␀n␀g␀e␀ ␀a␀n␀y␀ ␀o␀f␀ ␀y␀o␀u␀r␀ ␀i␀n␀s␀t␀a␀l␀l␀a␀t␀i␀o␀n␀ ␀s␀e␀t␀t␀i␀n␀g␀s␀,␀ ␀c␀l␀i␀c␀k␀ ␀B␀a␀c␀k␀.␀ ␀C␀l␀i␀c␀k␀ ␀C␀a␀n␀c␀e␀l␀ ␀t␀o␀ ␀e␀x␀i␀t␀ ␀t␀h␀e␀ ␀W␀i␀z␀a␀r␀d␀.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀€P}␀␀ö␀␀ë␀␀m␀s␀c␀t␀l␀s␀_␀p␀r␀o␀g␀r␀e␀s␀s␀3␀2␀␀␀P␀r␀o␀g␀r␀e␀s␀s␀1␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀P}␀‰␀ö␀␀ì␀␀ÿÿ‚␀I␀n␀s␀t␀a␀l␀l␀a␀t␀i␀o␀n␀ ␀p␀r␀o␀g␀r␀e␀s␀s␀:␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀P␀␀h␀£␀␀␀ÿÿ‚␀ÿÿn␀␀␀PA␀ÿÿ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀@␀ÀH␀␀␀␀␀{²␀␀␀␀␀S␀e␀t␀u␀p␀␀␀␀␀␀␀M␀S␀ ␀S␀a␀n␀s␀ ␀S␀e␀r␀i␀f␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀P}␀
